      "correct": 1,
      "explain": "An append-only ledger table (LEDGER = ON, APPEND_ONLY = ON) only allows INSERT operations, creating truly immutable, cryptographically verifiable records, unlike an updatable ledger table which still allows tracked UPDATE/DELETE."
