        "Implement Lakeflow Jobs: create/configure a job; configure triggers, schedules, alerts; configure automatic restarts",
        "Implement development lifecycle processes: apply Git version control best practices; manage branching, pull requests, conflict resolution; implement testing strategy (unit, integration, end-to-end, UAT); configure and package Databricks Asset Bundles; deploy a bundle via CLI or REST APIs",
        "Monitor, troubleshoot, and optimize workloads: monitor/manage cluster consumption; troubleshoot Lakeflow Jobs (repair, restart, stop, run); troubleshoot Spark jobs/notebooks (performance tuning, resource bottlenecks, cluster restart); investigate caching/skewing/spilling/shuffle issues via DAG, Spark UI, query profile; optimize Delta tables (OPTIMIZE, VACUUM); implement log streaming via Log Analytics/Azure Monitor; configure alerts via Azure Monitor"
